<p class="ion-aff-term-line">(b) Although we want your Posts to be authentic, your Posts should only include factual statements about the Company and our products. We may provide you with a list of verified factual statements that you may use in your Posts. Your Posts should also rely on the materials provided by the Affiliate Tool to accurately use our trademarks and describe our products.</p>
<p class="ion-aff-term-line">(c) You shall never: (i) make medical or health claims in your Posts (avoid suggestions that the Company’s products build muscle; increase fat loss; improve sleep, libido, or skin; treat or prevent diseases; etc.); (ii) state or imply in your Posts that the Company’s products are intended for anything other than laboratory research purposes; (iii) state or imply in your Posts that the Company’s products are for human or animal consumption; (iv) state or imply in your Posts that the Company’s products should be used as a food, drug, cosmetic, or other household use; (v) state or imply in your Posts that anything contained on the Company’s website should be construed as medical advice; (vi) provide dosage or administration information in your Posts; or (vii) use any bodybuilding or biohacking language in your Posts (i.e., “anti-aging,” “performance enhancing,” “muscle gain,” “fat burner,” “nootropic,” etc.).</p>
<p class="ion-aff-term-line">(d) Your Posts will reflect your own honest opinions, beliefs, and experiences.</p>
