<p class="ion-aff-term-line">11. Termination. Either party may terminate your participation in the Affiliate Program at any time and for any reason, with or without cause, by giving the other party written or electronic notice of termination, in accordance with the Affiliate Program Agreement. We may terminate immediately upon your violation of these Affiliate Guidelines.</p>
<p class="ion-aff-term-line">12. Relationship of the Parties. You understand that you are an independent contractor, and these Affiliate Guidelines, in addition to the Affiliate Program Agreement, do not create any association, partnership, joint venture, employee, or agency relationship between you and us for any purpose. You have no authority (and will not hold yourself out as having authority) to bind the Company and will not make any agreements or representations on our behalf without our prior written consent.</p>
