<p class="ion-aff-term-line">(c) If any provision of these Affiliate Guidelines is illegal or unenforceable under applicable law, the remainder of the provision will be amended to achieve as closely as possible the effect of the original terms and all other provisions of these Affiliate Guidelines will continue in full force and effect. These Affiliate Guidelines are incorporated by reference into the Affiliate Program Agreement, and, together with the Affiliate Program Agreement, contain the entire agreement between you and us and supersede any oral or written statements made by or to you in connection with the Affiliate Program and the Posts.</p>
